---
classes:
 - landing
description: Landing page with a framed, centered image, the publication title, and a Next button
layout: base.11ty.js
---
{% comment %}
Alternative to cover.liquid for content/index.md. Where the cover stretches its
image edge to edge behind the title, this centers the image whole, at its own
proportions, so a transparent PNG sits on the page background, with a Next
button under the title in place of the cover's scroll-down text. Styles are in
content/_assets/styles/custom.css under `.landing`.
{% endcomment %}

{% if image %}
{% assign imagePath = config.figures.imageDir | concat: image | join: '/' %}
{% endif %}

<section class="landing__hero">
  {% if image %}
    <img class="landing__image" src="{{ imagePath }}" alt="{{ image_alt }}" />
  {% endif %}
  <h1 class="landing__title" id="page-header-{{ page.filePathStem }}">
    {{ publication.title | markdownify }}
    {% if publication.subtitle %}
      <span class="visually-hidden">: </span>
      <span class="landing__subtitle">{{ publication.subtitle | markdownify }}</span>
    {% endif %}
  </h1>
  {% pageButtons pagination=pagination %}
</section>
